  "description": "Provides an adapter to the Albanian Tax Authorities fiscal service. This makes it easier to handle fiscalisation procedures with simple .net objects and interfaces",
  "id": "IVA.FiskalizeThis.AlbFiscAdapter",
  "isPrerelease": false,
