  "releaseNotes": "2.13.2\n      Bug fix eInvo units.json \n      2.13.1\n      Added logs for reconcile eInvoice + configurewait(false)\n      2.13.0\n      Switched to auto package references\n      2.12.1\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.7.2 (removes SSL verification)\n      2.12.0\n      Changed response to the original tax server response for list of invoices\n      2.11.0\n      Added GetDocumentsResponse model for fetching multiple documents\n      2.10.0\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.7.0 (adds support for new fiscal service endpoints)\n      2.9.1\n      Changed certificate loading to use DefaultKeySet for net472.\n      Use Fiscalization 2.6.1\n      2.9.0\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.6.0 (http client optimization)\n      2.8.1\n      Improved certificate cache clearing to clear also fiscalization cache\n      2.8.0\n      Certificate caching to check for ValidTo date\n      2.7.0\n      Changed unregistertcr to accept a validto date\n      2.6.1\n      Changed cert loading to machinekeys instead of efemeral\n      2.6.0\n      Added ProjectReference for eInvoice\n      2.5.4\n      Fixed missing check for certificate on FiscalizeInvoice call\n      Updated default fisc timeout from 30 to 2s\n      Removed GenerateIIC and VerificationLink methods\n      2.5.3\n      Improve certificate load and dispose\n      2.5.2\n      Added info logger for BU registration\n      2.5.1\n      Fixed WTN retry\n      2.5.0\n      Register and unregister BUs in the Tax Authority Server\n      2.4.1\n      Fixed a bug where eInvoiceService was asking for the Configs object to set its settings\n      2.4.0\n      Removed uneccessary packages\n      2.3.1\n      Minor package dependencies update (CommonComponents)\n      2.3.0\n      Updated Fiscalisation package to 2.2.0 (removed dependency on SFL)\n      2.2.1\n      Added Check Certificate on Calls before Fiscalizing\n      2.2.0\n      Set IsCorrective instead of IsDebit when DocRef is Refused\n      2.1.0\n      Removed check certificate on service init\n      2.0.0\n      Made TcrOrdNum as string to allow for custom TCR like 'POS01' or 'SAD01'\n      1.0.1\n      Updated Models dependency\n      1.0.0\n      Initial release",
